// Creatures. Stats are species bases; an individual's stats grow with level and its talents (rules.ron).
//   elements: up to two (Neutral, Fire, Water, Leaf, Spark, Frost, Earth)
//   jobs: talent rank per job id (jobs.ron), 1..5      hands: can do jobs that need hands
//   learnset: (level, skill id) from skills.ron          bond: bond skill id (bonds.ron)
//   drops: (item, chance 0..1, min, max) when defeated   ranch: loot table (world.ron) made at a Ranch
//   size: body radius in metres                          speeds in m/s, sight in metres
//   model: primitive parts in units of the body radius, facing -Z (the body part is the one that
//          flashes when hit); `mirror: true` adds a copy on the other side (x -> -x)
